==English==

===Noun===
'''virii''' {{p}}

# {{colloquial }} {{irregular plural of|[[virus]]}}
# {{computing}} A superset of computer software composed of computer [[virus|viruses]], [[trojan|trojans]], and [[worms]].

====Usage notes====
*The plural {{term|virii}}, though common, is generally less common than ''viruses'' and based on a misapplication of Latin. There is no plural for the Latin word {{term|virus|lang=la}}; using the native English pluralisation rules, to yield ''viruses'', would arguably then be most correct.
*The term {{term|virii}} in the computing sense is often used by individuals who collect, trade, and produce these kinds of software.

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|in computing}} [[malware]]

